# The Mega EEST commit mega-evm's CI gates on (scripts/mega_eest.sh, the Mega EEST gate in
# .github/workflows/mega-eest.yml). Mega EEST is the conformance suite both Satin implementations
# share; every case it holds at this commit must pass on this tree, plain and instrumented.
#
# Moving the pin is the one-line change of MEGA_EEST_REV, to a full commit on the default branch of
# the repository below, in the pull request that needs it: a change to mega-evm's API that the
# suite's revm adapter calls, or to behaviour a case pins, lands in Mega EEST first and is then
# pinned here. A commit off the default branch (a suite change still under review) keeps the gate
# red until the pin moves to the merged commit.
MEGA_EEST_REPO=https://github.com/RealiCZ/mega-eest
MEGA_EEST_REV=ab250afa0b24dd011857e7d65eda9f47b1b7d6b8
# The case ids the pin's last move removed, and those it changed under their ids (another file
# digest), each space-separated and exact: a pull request that moves the pin to a commit whose slice
# drops or rewrites cases lists them here, or the gate fails; a move that removes or changes none
# leaves the line empty. Cases are mega-evm's tests of the behaviours they pin, so a removal or a
# change is a line the reviewer reads in this file's diff.
MEGA_EEST_REMOVED_CASES=
MEGA_EEST_CHANGED_CASES=satin/access-control/delegate-refusal/call-cold-target-refusal-reads satin/access-control/delegate-refusal/callcode-cold-target-refusal-reads satin/access-control/delegate-refusal/delegatecall-cold-target-refusal-reads satin/access-control/delegate-refusal/max-forward-cold-target-refused satin/access-control/delegate-refusal/max-forward-warm-target-refused satin/access-control/delegate-refusal/value-call-at-the-guard satin/access-control/delegate-refusal/value-call-refused satin/access-control/delegate-refusal/value-callcode-refused satin/accounting/fee-account/beneficiary-is-sender satin/accounting/merge/creation-endowment-unfunded satin/accounting/sender/value-call-to-sender satin/authorizations/absent-authority satin/authorizations/limit/one-over-all-or-nothing satin/authorizations/limit/one-over-with-fees satin/authorizations/reads/simulation-past-crossing satin/call-order/unfunded/empty-account satin/detention/delegate-refusal/memory-crossing-reads-nothing satin/detention/delegate-refusal/surcharge-crossing satin/detention/delegate-refusal/surcharge-crossing-keeps-the-memory satin/detention/delegate-refusal/surcharge-crossing-one-short satin/detention/delegate-refusal/surcharge-paid satin/gas-pools/first-frame-revert/authorization-charges-kept satin/keyless/authorizations/1001-new-authorities satin/keyless/contract-call/no-value satin/keyless/refusal/signer-has-code satin/keyless/refusal/signer-nonce-two satin/keyless/refusal/taken-and-unfunded satin/limit-stops/authorization-list/one-authority-over satin/oracle/send-hint/stipend-unfunded satin/outcomes/pre-frame/created-account-one-short satin/outcomes/pre-frame/created-account-paid satin/outcomes/revert/after-fresh-slot satin/reads/balance-cold-paid satin/reads/balance-cold-unpaid satin/reads/oracle-slot-before-charge satin/selfdestruct/created/fresh-slot-on-little-gas satin/selfdestruct/marked/fresh-slot-on-little-gas satin/selfdestruct/not-created/new-beneficiary-caller-reverts satin/system-contracts/limit-control/own-call-with-value satin/take-backs/sent-back/round-trip
# The repository the suite moved from, exactly as the base's MEGA_EEST_REPO reads, set by the pull
# request that changes MEGA_EEST_REPO: the default branch the pin must be on is that repository's,
# so a change of repository fails the gate unless it is declared here, and the pin must then be on
# the new repository's default branch. A pull request that keeps MEGA_EEST_REPO and sets this line
# fails the gate as stale; the line a merged move left only warns, and is cleared later.
MEGA_EEST_REPO_MOVED_FROM=
